# Instance env files (.env.qa / .env.production) hold only public URLs — no
# secrets — and MUST be committed so `npm run build:qa|build:prod` (e.g. on a
# fresh clone / Jenkins) resolve real hosts instead of falling back to localhost.
!.env.qa
!.env.production

